All probing done against isolated fixtures (mktemp dirs, BUDGET_DATA_DIR-scoped
`go build -o $WORK/srv ./cmd/server` servers on :8299/:8199); the live `data`
symlink (-> /home/darrell/bin/ai/budget2/data) was never touched, confirmed by
